### Variables comunes
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = PONER_TOKEN_JWT_AQUI

### Listar solicitudes
GET {{baseUrl}}/solicitudes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Crear solicitud
POST {{baseUrl}}/solicitudes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteId": 1,
  "contenedor": {
    "pesoKg": 2500,
    "volumenM3": 12
  },
  "origenDireccion": "Calle 123, Córdoba",
  "destinoDireccion": "Ruta 9 km 500"
}

###

### Obtener solicitud por ID
@solicitudId = 1

GET {{baseUrl}}/solicitudes/{{solicitudId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Ver seguimiento de una solicitud
GET {{baseUrl}}/solicitudes/{{solicitudId}}/seguimiento
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Iniciar tramo
@tramoId = 1

PUT {{baseUrl}}/tramos/{{tramoId}}/iniciar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Finalizar tramo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tramos/{{tramoId}}/finalizar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
